            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.14.12

- The previous button now restarts the current song, and goes to the song before it when you press it again. Swiping the album art still goes straight back.
- Fixed music resuming in a browser tab you had paused after a call or other microphone use.
]]></description>
