            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.14.11

- Fixed a song set to repeat sitting at the end of the track instead of following it back to the start. The progress bar and lyrics now pick up each replay.
- Fixed track details failing to load for music with large album art.
]]></description>
